      "attributes": {
        "whatsNew": "Direct Jev connection: this iPhone now calls TypeSafe using the personal API key included in this internal build. Live detection and camera capture do not require a Mac address or pairing token. Jev requests a fresh category and bounding box about every 200 ms. Errors now distinguish internet connection, invalid key, credits and rate limits. Tap Scan outlined object to capture. The existing 3D reconstruction and CAD export pipeline still uses the paired Mac. Public Apple processed depth plus the rear camera; no private sensor hooks. Physical accuracy remains unverified.",
